# No-dot variants (env.example, env.local) are NOT matched by the .env / .env.*
# rules above. They have leaked real secrets before — the only committed template
# is .env.example (with the leading dot). Never commit these. (Scoped to these
# exact names so legit sources like lib/env.ts are unaffected.)
env.example
env.local
**/env.example
**/env.local
.claude/settings.local.json
